{% set b = boot.value ?? {} %}
<section class="card" aria-labelledby="rb-h">
<h2 id="rb-h">Prove a restart</h2>
<p>catto-mail must come back by itself after the server restarts: Ubuntu → the catto-mail user's systemd (lingering) → Podman → the containers → the ingress socket → nginx. Prove it once.</p>
<ol class="plain">
<li>Make sure nothing important is being sent (or press <em>Stop sending email now</em> first).</li>
<li>On the server, as root: <code>reboot</code>.</li>
<li>Wait two or three minutes, sign in again and reload this page.</li>
</ol>
</section>
<section class="card" aria-labelledby="rb-last-h">
<h2 id="rb-last-h">Last boot</h2>
{% if boot is null %}<p class="empty">No boot report yet: the host agent writes one shortly after each start of the server.</p>{% else %}
<dl class="rows">
<dt>Server booted</dt><dd>{{ b.boot_time ?? '?' }}</dd>
<dt>catto-mail started automatically</dt><dd>{{ b.started_automatically is defined ? (b.started_automatically ? 'yes' : 'NO') : '?' }} {% if b.unit_started_at is defined %}<small class="muted">(smarthost.service at {{ b.unit_started_at }})</small>{% endif %}</dd>
<dt>All containers healthy</dt><dd>{{ b.containers_healthy is defined ? (b.containers_healthy ? 'yes' : 'NO: ' ~ (b.unhealthy ?? [])|join(', ')) : '?' }}</dd>
<dt>Ingress socket (ports 443 and 25)</dt><dd>{{ b.ingress_active is defined ? (b.ingress_active ? 'active' : 'NOT active') : '?' }}</dd>
<dt>Delivery mode after boot</dt><dd>{{ b.live_delivery is defined ? (b.live_delivery ? 'LIVE' : 'HELD') : '?' }}{% if b.paused is defined and b.paused %}, PAUSED (preserved){% endif %}</dd>
<dt>Recorded</dt><dd>{{ boot.updated_at|ts }}</dd>
</dl>{% endif %}
</section>
